&io;
// The smallest complete Synth-OOP program. / 最小的完整 Synth-OOP 程序。
//
// A program IS the construction of its `$Program` class: the entry point is
// the `@::` (construct) behavior, and instantiation is the whole lifecycle.
// `&io;` ships the ready-made const object `out` — no declaration needed.
// `[{ ... }]` is the block sugar for `[() -> () { ... }]`.
// 程序就是 `$Program` 类的构造过程：入口是 `@::`（构造行为），实例化即整个
// 生命周期。`&io;` 自带成品常数对象 `out`——无需声明。`[{ ... }]` 是
// `[() -> () { ... }]` 的代码块语法糖。
$Program {
    @:: << [{
        io::out.push_line("Hello, Synth-OOP!");
    }];
}
